<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, July 23 - Karachi - Vessels waiting off port, one general cargo waiting for one day, and one oil tanker waiting for two days. Two vessels waiting off port for own reasons.</p>
